            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AcaCandy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used Swiss cheese and added half of a grilled chile poblano (similar to the green chiles in a can, but fresh). I also sprinkled some ground black pepper and garlic chips ontop of the burgers prior to putting them on the grill.",
